Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> expression
Rule 1     expression -> CONST
Rule 2     expression -> WHILE expression DO LBRACE expression RBRACE
Rule 3     expression -> IF expression THEN expression ELSE expression
Rule 4     expression -> ID
Rule 5     expression -> expression AOP expression
Rule 6     expression -> expression RELOP expression
Rule 7     expression -> expression LOP expression
Rule 8     expression -> BOOL
Rule 9     expression -> expression COMMA expression
Rule 10    expression -> expression SEMI expression
Rule 11    expression -> LET expression IN expression
Rule 12    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 13    expression -> LBRACE expression RBRACE
Rule 14    expression -> expression ASSIGN expression

